160;31, 2025:</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:8pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:70.374%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:12.842%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.441%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:12.843%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1.73pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.022em;line-height:9.00pt">June 30,<br/>2026</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.022em;line-height:9.00pt">December 31,<br/>2025</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ccedff;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Trade receivable</span></td><td style="background-color:#ccedff;border-top:0.5pt solid #231f20;padding:1.5pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#ccedff;border-top:0.5pt solid #231f20;padding:1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-2" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" scale="3" id="f-563">198</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-colo